#### Modal Adjuncts

Halliday & Matthiessen (2014: Table 3-5)

```cqp
InitialModalAdjuncts = <s> [word="\p{P}"]? /mwu_modaladjuncts[] within s;
/feature[InitialModalAdjuncts];
```

#### Finite Verbs

TODO: separate positive imperatives (experiential) from negatives imperatives and yes-no questions (interpersonal)

```cqp
InitialFiniteVerbs = <s> [word="\p{P}"]? [pos="VB([MRZ]|D[RZ])|VH[0DZ]|VD[DZ]" | pos="VMK?"] within s;
/feature[InitialFiniteVerbs];
```

### Other

#### Nonfinite Clauses

TODO: disambiguate experiential, interpersonal, and textual uses

```cqp
InitialToInfinitives = <s> [word="\p{P}"]? [pos="TO" | word="to"%c] [pos="R.+"]* [pos="V.I"] within s expand to s;
InitialParticiples = <s> [word="\p{P}"]? [pos="V.[GN].?"] within s expand to s;
/union[InitialNonFinites, InitialToInfinitives, InitialParticiples];
/feature[InitialNonFinites];
```

