### Material Processes

Halliday & Matthiessen (2014: Table 5-5)

```cqp
define $MaterialWords < "wordlists/process_types/MaterialWords.txt";
MaterialProcesses = [pos="V.+" & word=RE($MaterialWords)];
/feature[MaterialProcesses];
