### Mental Processes

Halliday & Matthiessen (2014: Table 5-10)

```cqp
MentalProcesses = [pos="V.+" & word=RE($MentalWords)];
/feature[MentalProcesses];
```

### Relational Processes

Halliday & Matthiessen (2014: Table 5-20, 5-21)

```cqp
# MU query with right constraint to avoid hits for cases like "was giving"
# Ideally, we would disallow any other verbs until the next clause.
BeHaveProcesses = MU(meet (meet [pos="V[BH].+"] not [pos="EX"]) not [pos="V.+"] 1 5);

define $RelationalWords < "wordlists/process_types/RelationalWords.txt";
RelationalWords = [pos="V.+" & word=RE($RelationalWords)%c];

/union[RelationalProcesses, BeHaveProcesses, RelationalWords];
/feature[RelationalProcesses];
```

### Verbal Processes

Halliday & Matthiessen (2014: 5-25)

