```

### Existential Processes

Halliday & Matthiessen (2014: Table 5-26)

TODO: metereological processes (considered kind of borderline)?

Uses some matching hacks for extracting the verb instead of *there*.

```cqp
define $ExistentialWords < "wordlists/process_types/ExistentialWords.txt";
ExistentialWords = TAB [word="there"%c] * [word=RE($ExistentialWords)%c] within s;
set ExistentialWords match matchend;

ExistentialPos = TAB [pos="EX"] * [pos="V.+"] within s;
set ExistentialPos match matchend;
ExistentialTheres = "there"%c (@[pos="V[BDH].+"] | (@[pos="VM"] | @[pos="VMK"] [pos="XX"]? [pos="TO"]?)) within s;
set ExistentialTheres match target;
set ExistentialTheres matchend target;
/union[ExistentialProcesses, ExistentialWords, ExistentialPos, ExistentialTheres];
/feature[ExistentialProcesses];
```
